					</div>
					<div class="card-body">
						<p>All pumps carry a 5 year warranty against manufacturer's defect, except for 2DX &amp; 5DX Cat pumps, which carry a 2 year warranty. Note that this warranty only applies to defective manufacturer's workmanship as determined by the applicable manufacturer. This warranty does not apply where customer neglect, abuse, or &quot;normal wear and tear&quot; is involved. Items such as seal and valve kits are not warrantable. Pumps and gearboxes have a 12 month warranty against &quot;normal wear and tear&quot; when not commercially used. When commercially used, the warranty period is 90 days. </p>
						<p><small>** BE Pressure Supply does not pay for labor.</small></p>
						<p>Engines are as per manufacturer&#8217;s warranty policy in their owner operator's manual. </p>
						<p>All other accessories and components, including Whirl-a-Ways and Long Wands, are warranted for 90 days against manufacturer's defects. Whirl-A-Way heads have a 6 month warranty and Rotary nozzles carry a&nbsp; warranty for &#8216;repair only&#8217; for 30 days from purchase. </p>
